# ==============================================================================
# Large Model Weights, Checkpoints & Training Artifacts
# ==============================================================================
# Model weights (.safetensors, .bin, .joblib) exceed GitHub 100MB file limit.
# Pre-trained models are hosted on Hugging Face:
# https://huggingface.co/spaces/ModeAR/healthclaimbert
*.pt
*.bin
*.safetensors
*.joblib
*.pkl
**/checkpoints/
**/model/
**/models/
models-backup/

